Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Produce a navigable asset-linked dossier and a separate outstanding-obligations register. Verify search, links, file integrity, and recipient access, then record documentary acceptance independently from any qualified technical approval or occupancy decision.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
